  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/can1357/oh-my-pi/zipball/v18.12.5",
  "body": "## @oh-my-pi/pi-ai\n\n### Added\n\n- Added OpenAI 12-hour prompt caching for GPT-5.6+ on the Responses API: `cacheRetention: \"long\"` now requests `prompt_cache_options.ttl: \"12h\"` (instead of the ignored legacy `prompt_cache_retention: \"24h\"`), and `promptCache.ttl` accepts `\"12h\"`\n\n### Fixed\n\n- Fixed every OpenAI Codex request failing with HTTP 404 `{\"detail\":\"Not Found\"}` on personal ChatGPT accounts whose token is not region-pinned ([#16493](https://github.com/can1357/oh-my-pi/issues/16493))\n\n## @oh-my-pi/pi-catalog\n\n### Fixed\n\n- Fixed Moonshot `kimi-k3` pricing cache writes at $0; usage cost now includes cache writes at Moonshot's $3/M 5-minute rate ([#16508](https://github.com/can1357/oh-my-pi/issues/16508))\n\n## @oh-my-pi/pi-coding-agent\n\n### Added\n\n- `providers.cacheRetention: long` now keeps OpenAI GPT-5.6+ prompt caches for 12 hours (Responses API; cache writes cost 2.5× input instead of 1.25×)\n\n### Fixed\n\n- Fixed subagents spawning at a caller-supplied `effort` (e.g. `hi` → `max`) while `task.enableEffort` is off; the field is now ignored and the agent's configured thinking level (including `:auto`) applies ([#16402](https://github.com/can1357/oh-my-pi/issues/16402))\n- Fixed `omp update --check` failing against JFrog Artifactory registries that add empty `dist-tags` to a tagged manifest; the update check now uses the registry's curated latest version ([#16375](https://github.com/can1357/oh-my-pi/issues/16375))\n- Fixed `<path>:conflicts` on a file past the 10 MiB scan cap reporting no conflicts with no hint: it now names the line the scan stopped at and the ranged `read` that registers the blocks after it ([#16269](https://github.com/can1357/oh-my-pi/pull/16269))\n- Fixed the `ts-set-map` rule stalling tool-call streaming for seconds on a long single-line `Map` literal, and missing `Map` entries written `[\"key\", value] as const` ([#16242](https://github.com/can1357/oh-my-pi/pull/16242))\n- Fixed the `ts-import-type` rule missing inline type imports whose member name is non-ASCII, such as `import(\"./units\").温度` ([#16242](https://github.com/can1357/oh-my-pi/pull/16242))\n\n## @oh-my-pi/pi-natives\n\n### Fixed\n\n- Fixed a macOS background action leaving its target in front of your app after you clicked another of your windows, when placing the click took longer than the click itself ([#16217](https://github.com/can1357/oh-my-pi/pull/16217))\n\n\n## What's Changed\n* fix(update): handled empty Artifactory dist-tags on tagged manifests by @roboomp in https://github.com/can1357/oh-my-pi/pull/16379\n* fix(task): ignored caller effort while task.enableEffort is off by @roboomp in https://github.com/can1357/oh-my-pi/pull/16406\n* fix(catalog): stopped declaring no_constraint codex residency by @roboomp in https://github.com/can1357/oh-my-pi/pull/16501\n* fix(catalog): priced moonshot kimi-k3 cache writes at the 5min rate by @roboomp in https://github.com/can1357/oh-my-pi/pull/16529\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/can1357/oh-my-pi/compare/v18.12.4...v18.12.5",
